Timeline Condensed

Power-on
  │
  ├─ BIOS/UEFI POST
  ├─ Bootloader loads vmlinuz + initrd
  ├─ start_kernel()
  │     ├─ mm init (buddy + SLUB)          ← memory for everything
  │     ├─ vfs_caches_init()               ← inodes, dentries, files possible
  │     └─ do_initcalls()
  │           ├─ core: sock_init()         ← sockfs mounted, socket() wired
  │           ├─ core: netlink_init()      ← AF_NETLINK ready
  │           └─ fs:   init_pipe_fs()      ← pipefs mounted, pipe() wired
  │                    af_unix_init()      ← AF_UNIX ready
